    "optical_checks": "Reproduce frozen estimator and its original pre-cut look-ahead check for every frame. Enumerate exact rays contributing to a vetoed bin and record the same coordinates before and after the veto: color, chromatic mask, cut band, bin, measured depth and fitted plane depth. Compare the bin population and identify which per-ray predicates changed. As offline controls at tick 31, swap only tick 30 RGB, only tick 30 depth, or both into the original tick 31 state at matched calibration. Mixed frames are causal diagnostics only, never images or clearance evidence for action.",
